WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.925
Here's Microsoft's starting point.

2
00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:05.368
Learn's page gives portal
steps for both kinds of policy,

3
00:00:05.368 --> 00:00:09.709
says to save them report-only first,
tells you where to read the results,

4
00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:13.975
and ends with one sample policy in
JSON for the beta Graph endpoint.

5
00:00:13.975 --> 00:00:16.510
The repository searched Microsoft's sample

6
00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.387
repositories and found
nothing else to start from.

7
00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:24.034
So the page is pinned, unmodified, with
checked hashes and a weekly watch,

8
00:00:24.034 --> 00:00:28.602
and its one JSON block is extracted
and sent to a fake Graph and to the

9
00:00:28.602 --> 00:00:33.070
program's own pre-merge check, exactly
as if someone had committed it.
